cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Kopist or the Agent Content Trust specification in research, please cite it as below."
title: "Kopist: a local-first content trust gateway for AI agents"
abstract: >-
  Kopist reconstructs web content for AI agents instead of forwarding it, labels every output with
  provenance and trust information, issues signed content receipts, and enforces default-deny egress.
  It includes the Agent Content Trust specification for labels and receipts.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "The Kopist Authors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/kwdwetz/gateway"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - prompt injection
  - AI agents
  - content disarm and reconstruction
  - provenance
  - AI security
